From: aleferri b43-ac-wip
Subject: [PATCH] b43: AC-PHY carry of b43/phy_ac.c from tree 6ba9f87c (816 base) to e6daa3b0 (3517def)

Not regenerated upstream yet; the femctrl 1 table and the IQ cal rework.
---
diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/phy_ac.c b/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/phy_ac.c
index adc50de..3848285 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/phy_ac.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/b43/phy_ac.c
@@ -3084,6 +3084,11 @@ static const u32 b43_acphy_txv_for_spexp[243] = {
  *   femctrl 2, sub 1  fem5516_fc1 on cores 0 and 2, x29c_c1_fc2_sub1 on
  *                     core 1, plus b43_phy_ac_fem2_sub1_setup():
  *                     MacBookAir6,1.
+ *   femctrl 1, sub 0  fem5516_fc1 on every core, after bit 8 of 0x040a
+ *                     (b43_phy_ac_fem_040a_set()): archer-t5e
+ *                     (router-data/archer-t5e/mmiotrace.zip, #7128-#7234).
+ *                     The same 6.30.223 as the MacBook's sets that bit
